cff-version: 1.2.0
title: RVC Voice Conversion Trainer for Runpod Serverless
message: If you use this worker, please cite it and the upstream RVC project.
type: software
authors:
  - name: prilojject
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/prilojject/runpod-rvc-trainer
url: https://prilojject.github.io/runpod-rvc-trainer/
abstract: >-
  A Runpod Serverless worker that trains Retrieval-based Voice Conversion
  models (default RVC v2, 40 kHz, F0=rmvpe) from a zip of one speaker's
  audio and returns inference-ready .pth and .index files.
keywords:
  - rvc
  - voice-conversion
  - speech
  - runpod
  - serverless
references:
  - type: software
    title: Retrieval-based-Voice-Conversion-WebUI
    authors:
      - name: RVC-Project
    repository-code: https://github.com/RVC-Project/Retrieval-based-Voice-Conversion-WebUI
    license: MIT
